[gd_scene load_steps=8 format=3 uid="uid://cb6stepdustprev"]

; Effect C's fixture. The background is a real stretch of this level: the same
; room_backdrop.gd the game draws, the same floor tile, the same three traps
; so the lit lip breaks where it does in play, and the real player driven by
; real key events. Camera and geometry match game/main.tscn.
; CHANGE-BRIEF.md revision 6.0.4 section C.5.
;
; The player starts at x 48 and turns around at x 150, which keeps it clear of
; SpikeTrap1's detection zone (it starts at x 175) for the whole capture.

